CORE
main.cpp
--cpp11
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* T \* deduced: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* T & deduced: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* const T & deduced: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
